
- TIME-SPANNING: If the action involves travel to a distant location, long movement, or
  environmental traversal that takes HOURS (not seconds), set time_spanning to true.
  - time_span_type: "journey" for travel to a destination. Set to null if not time_spanning.
  - destination: the name of the target location from the STORY LOCATIONS above, if any.
    Match the player's words to the closest location name. Set to null if no match.
  - estimated_hours: null for journeys (the app computes distance). For other time_spanning
    traversal, estimate hours.
  Short movements (30 feet, crossing a room, climbing a wall) are NOT time_spanning.
